          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "(sum(prometheus_rule_group_rules{rule_group=~\".*;(dpf-component-health|dpf-replica-health|dpucluster-control-plane|dpf-operator-self|dpf-lifecycle)$\"}) or vector(0)) - (count(count by(alertname) (ALERTS{service=\"doca-platform-framework\"})) or vector(0))",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "Value",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Inactive (Normal)",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "Number of DPF alert rules currently in Normal/Inactive state. Derived from prometheus_rule_group_rules minus the count of active ALERTS, so it stays accurate as rules are added or removed from the installed PrometheusRule manifests."
